# GitHub personal access token used by this service (sent as "Authorization: Bearer <token>").
# Create one at https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens (fine-grained) with:
#   - Repository access: the repos you want to use
#   - Permissions: Metadata (read), Issues (read and write)
# The service stays unloaded until this is filled in; saving this file hot-reloads it.
# A real environment variable named GITHUB_TOKEN takes precedence over this file.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
